OL,3,GNEWSAStriking doctors warn staff will  
OL,4,Aleave NI for better pay                
OL,6,FHealth Minister Robbie Butler said he  
OL,7,Fwould try to do "everything in my      
OL,8,Fpower" to implement this year's pay    
OL,9,Faward - but said he was unable to do so
OL,10,Fat present in the absence of a Stormont
OL,11,Fbudget.                                
